<title>USA: Maxtor to cut 150-200 jobs.</title>
<headline>Maxtor to cut 150-200 jobs.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxtor Corp said it will cut 150-200 employees from its worldwide work force later this month.</p>
<p>The company currently has abut 4,800 employees.</p>
<p>It said the majority of jobs will be cut at its Longmont, Colorodo facility. The company makes information storage products for desktop and mobile computer systems.</p>
